#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:3
#: dc1782411e624e9b80304670e399a99c
msgid "折返螺旋磁序（Folded Helix）"
msgstr "Folded Helix"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:5
#: f93312e886454f02837c878a7958f014
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:7
#: 8696aba1fd8a45e58ba5bf40e9a7184e
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:9
#: ec2782519ce44468b0ae68dad7bfeef4
msgid ""
"这张卡把原子按指定方向分层，并为各层写入“逐层转动 → 到达转折点 → "
"反向转回”的确定性磁矩方向。输出是镜面对称或周期重复的三角相位纹理，磁矩模长保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Divide atoms into layers along a specified direction and assign "
"deterministic moment directions that rotate layer by layer, reach a "
"turning point, then rotate back. The output is a mirror-symmetric or "
"periodically repeated triangular phase texture, with moment magnitudes "
"unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:11
#: 167b6c1e8226402fbfd3960b1d2d5eed
msgid "它与其他磁性卡的边界是："
msgstr "Its role differs from other magnetic cards:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:13
#: b0a25dac15504ace97b8b9f75912738d
#
msgid "`SOC / 纹理响应` 生成单向线性有限 q 纹理；本卡的相位是非单调折返的。"
msgstr ""
"`SOC / Texture Response` generates a one-way linear finite-q texture; "
"this card uses a nonmonotonic folded phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:14
#: 52d7927f384f49fd8e60a60eb3e94e75
msgid "`空间关联磁矩` 和 `磁矩扰动` 生成随机方向；本卡没有随机性。"
msgstr "`Correlated Spins` and `Spin Perturb` generate random directions; this card has no randomness."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:16
#: 724e913318854d1eb749259e8fbedb45
msgid "输入必须沿分层方向识别出至少 3 层，并且目标元素中至少有一个非零磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"The input must yield at least three layers along the layering direction "
"and contain at least one nonzero moment among the target elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:18
#: db810eac908d49c19e4a871e9ce2abaf
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:20
#: 92fedaf22f1a427eb6f4394a0e833fda
msgid "设按笛卡尔方向 `layer_axis` 排序后共有 $N$ 层，层号为 $k=0,\\ldots,N-1$。"
msgstr ""
"After sorting along Cartesian direction `layer_axis`, let there be $N$ "
"layers indexed by $k=0,\\ldots,N-1$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:22
#: 44ae9ba786f04f8fb21fa215357a6e2d
msgid "自动模式只在整个层堆栈上折返一次："
msgstr "Automatic mode folds only once across the full layer stack:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:24
#: 10329406103a48079468ee2101a1ccb3
msgid ""
"\n"
"s_{\\mathrm{auto}}(k)=\\min(k,N-1-k).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:28
#: 54a578b5158b46b8abaf99a773106938
msgid "手动模式用半周期 $h$ 构造可重复三角波。令 $r=k\\bmod 2h$，则"
msgstr ""
"Manual mode uses a half-period $h$ to construct a repeating triangular "
"wave. Let $r=k\\bmod 2h$; then"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:30
#: 4386b7961dfd46a793d92511b2768577
msgid ""
"\n"
"s_{\\mathrm{manual}}(k)=\\min(r,2h-r).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:34
#: 872cab1b931e481ba64b72f4d2d786c3
msgid "第 $i$ 个原子属于第 $k_i$ 层，其相位和磁矩为"
msgstr "If atom $i$ belongs to layer $k_i$, its phase and moment are"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:36
#: 69024e3e224e4ee498046891475af02a
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\phi_i=\\phi_0+\\sigma s(k_i)\\Delta\\phi,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:40
#: 9323c33c7031474c995a932fb6afd7d1
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M_i\\left(\\cos\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_1+\n"
"\\sin\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_2\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:45
#: 57d13f2d4d8b418eb2bfb53f44c5ebe4
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf e_1$、$\\mathbf e_2$ 位于 `plane_normal` 垂直的平面内；$M_i$ "
"是输入或元素表给出的磁矩模长；$\\sigma=\\pm1$ 对应两种相反的折返方向。"
msgstr ""
"$\\mathbf e_1$ and $\\mathbf e_2$ lie in the plane perpendicular to "
"`plane_normal`; $M_i$ is the moment magnitude from the input or element "
"table; $\\sigma=\\pm1$ represents the two opposite folding directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:47
#: 349776b1ba3e46a98c1b15c0e02b84c6
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:49
#: 3d93dfb6374345cda1d22cadc3b74296
msgid "一个沿 z 方向有 8 层、每层 Fe 磁矩模长为 2 的结构，使用自动模式、每层 30°、初相位 90°时，层相位为："
msgstr ""
"For a structure with eight layers along z and Fe moment magnitude 2 in "
"every layer, automatic mode with 30° per layer and an initial phase of "
"90° gives layer phases:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:51
#: 65ec1ecb4ff24556b75ca0e95af9109f
msgid "90°, 60°, 30°, 0°, 0°, 30°, 60°, 90°\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:55
#: b8d8165b1846438b9b4bf1d4c61d80c2
msgid "选择 `Both` 会生成另一份方向相反的完整配对。检查输出时确认：同层原子方向一致、相位到中部后反向、首尾层方向相同、目标磁矩模长没有改变。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting `Both` generates a complete partner with the opposite "
"direction. Check that atoms within each layer share a direction, the "
"phase reverses after the middle, the first and last layers have the same "
"direction, and target moment magnitudes are unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:57
#: 5046d04df1ca4a1dbfeb2adc5fb1a689
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:59
#: d3917078caf24026be4646b192d5f8c1
msgid "层方向（layer_axis）"
msgstr "Layer Direction (layer_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:61
#: 157abc5f72624b999c2781bff775c8fd
msgid "默认 `(0,0,1)`，笛卡尔方向。程序把原子位置投影到该方向后识别层；它不是 Miller 指数或晶格轴编号。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0,0,1)`, a Cartesian direction. The program projects atomic "
"positions onto this direction to identify layers; it is neither a Miller "
"index nor a lattice-axis identifier."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:63
#: 9e51ce5f2e9043968a72f5d4a11d7a83
msgid "旋转平面法向（plane_normal）"
msgstr "Rotation-Plane Normal (plane_normal)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:65
#: ef04c0c902394e4090969c48e5211f2c
msgid ""
"默认跟随 "
"`layer_axis`，因此磁矩直接在原子层面内旋转，普通用户不需要再填写第二个方向。只有选择“自定义磁矩平面”后才显示该笛卡尔向量；例如 "
"`(0,0,1)` 表示在 xy 平面旋转。旧 JSON 中与层方向不同的法向会自动恢复为自定义模式。"
msgstr ""
"By default, it follows `layer_axis`, so moments rotate directly within "
"the atomic-layer plane and most users need not enter a second direction. "
"This Cartesian vector appears only after selecting `Custom moment plane`;"
" for example, `(0,0,1)` means rotation in the xy plane. A normal in "
"legacy JSON that differs from the layer direction automatically restores "
"custom mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:67
#: b31be05091364b13a38a92d3176af0b8
msgid "分层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr "Layering Tolerance (layer_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:69
#: eb9a9f4900544ae2901c9487169a5d53
msgid "默认 0.05 Å。投影距离不超过该值的原子归为同一层。过大会合并相邻层，过小会把有层内起伏的原子拆开。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.05 Å. Atoms whose projected distances differ by no more than "
"this value are assigned to the same layer. A large value merges adjacent "
"layers; a small value splits atoms with intralayer corrugation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:71
#: 62a461438c364776b18a897cf8a488eb
msgid "半周期模式（half_period_mode）"
msgstr "half_period_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:73
#: 21bf718128504556a5c3a5c30f0578de
msgid "默认 `Auto from layer count`。自动模式在检测出的完整层堆栈上折返一次；`Manual` 按指定半周期重复三角相位。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Auto from layer count`. Automatic mode folds once across the "
"full detected layer stack; `Manual` repeats the triangular phase using "
"the specified half-period."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:75
#: 822a8348fa874704bc7e18dd8c91062b
msgid "半周期层步数（half_period_layers）"
msgstr "Layer Steps per Half-Period (half_period_layers)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:77
#: 739d132757854ac7aed33992f064acd6
msgid "默认 `(2,4,1)`，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，仅在手动模式下使用。$h=2$ 表示每经过两个层间步进到达一次转折点。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(2,4,1)`, in `[minimum, maximum, step]` form, used only in "
"manual mode. $h=2$ means that a turning point is reached after every two "
"interlayer steps."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:79
#: d588dffe2c13470d89597eb106bab65b
msgid "每层角度变化（angle_step_range）"
msgstr "Angle Change per Layer (angle_step_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:81
#: a98c03984fb24ac99dc9717e470e215f
msgid "默认 `(15,45,15)`°，格式为 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`。它控制相邻层的相位增量；折返点之后符号自动反转。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(15,45,15)`°, in `[minimum, maximum, step]` form. It controls "
"the phase increment between adjacent layers; the sign reverses "
"automatically after a turning point."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:83
#: b733c273e20e4b6cae8c4eb8dd9cce10
msgid "全局相位（phase_range）"
msgstr "Global Phase (phase_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:85
#: 964a477d3f664174805dfadf1317b629
msgid "默认 `(0,0,15)`°。每个取值都会把完整折返纹理在旋转平面内整体转动，并增加一组输出。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0,0,15)`°. Each value rotates the entire folded texture within "
"the rotation plane and adds another set of outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:87
#: 7d4530d109764d3ea97e81d55345b320
msgid "折返方向（sequence_mode）"
msgstr "Folding Direction (sequence_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:89
#: 68a4b63f53864a749d8cb2199fb23cb6
msgid ""
"默认 `Clockwise then counterclockwise`。反向选项改变 $\\sigma$；`Both` "
"总是输出完整的正反方向配对，输出上限不会拆散一对。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Clockwise then counterclockwise`. The reverse option changes "
"$\\sigma$; `Both` always outputs a complete pair of opposite directions, "
"and the output limit never splits a pair."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:91
#: 466dd95196934f29b111236ead729c32
msgid "磁矩来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "Moment Source (magnitude_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:93
#: c2f4ea236efc4eb289c0488b950c1114
msgid ""
"默认 `Existing initial magmoms`，要求输入已有非零磁矩，缺失时明确报错。选择 `Map/default "
"magnitude` 后才会根据元素表建立目标磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Existing initial magmoms`, requiring existing nonzero moments in"
" the input and reporting an explicit error when they are absent. Target "
"moment magnitudes are built from the element table only after selecting "
"`Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:95
#: 3d763748af114a4c9f5314d751108980
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:97
#: dda4b7b950fc4f3ba9c670bb319bd096
msgid "仅在元素表模式下使用，格式如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。"
msgstr "Used only in element-table mode, with a format such as `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:99
#: a041a2211f1b4ac68648e0cb18bf2c50
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:101
#: b1b420f8dc9c419ab483010d65cba5ad
msgid "默认 0.0，仅在元素表模式下使用，作为表中未列出元素的模长。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0.0, used only in element-table mode as the magnitude for "
"elements absent from the table."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:103
#: 985a7b7dd6ac447094d853dcdb2e4a64
msgid "目标元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "Target Elements (apply_elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:105
#: c8daea5acea0455a96c993188d0d28d7
msgid "默认留空，表示所有元素。可填写 `Fe,Co` 等逗号分隔符号；未选中的已有磁矩保持原方向和模长。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default, meaning all elements. Enter comma-separated symbols "
"such as `Fe,Co`; unselected existing moments retain their original "
"directions and magnitudes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:107
#: 42015468424f43a18282bd55645ad887
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:109
#: 4d4fcb53d33f4dcb8dd4ec6bf63d2bab
msgid "默认 100。理论数量为"
msgstr "Default 100. The theoretical count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:111
#: 23a5ca0ccf834cd598e63807614c2a3d
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_h\\times N_{\\Delta\\phi}\\times N_{\\phi_0}\\times "
"N_{\\mathrm{sequence}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:115
#: aed38b35ac2f4c25a201ca04dfd1d5eb
msgid "达到上限后停止生成。`Both` 模式以两份为一组，因此奇数上限会向下取到最近的完整偶数；上限小于 2 时明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Generation stops at the limit. `Both` mode produces pairs, so an odd "
"limit is rounded down to the nearest complete even count; a limit below 2"
" reports an explicit error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:117
#: 2a82119013004daa8d16ef6922144e48
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:119
#: f82b2374ac0344d9bca3da97c935e9fa
msgid "**为什么提示检测层数不足？** 折返至少需要“起点—转折—返回”三层。检查层方向是否正确，并确认分层容差没有把不同层合并。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are too few layers detected?** Folding requires at least three "
"layers for start, turn, and return. Check the layer direction and confirm"
" that the layering tolerance has not merged distinct layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:121
#: 39e2c27fa71945b78ca7dc0bcb9ae1fb
msgid ""
"**为什么输出数比理论数量少？** `max_outputs` 限制了扫描预算。界面会同时显示理论数量和预算内实际数量；`Both` "
"不会只保留单侧方向。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the output count smaller than the theoretical count?** "
"`max_outputs` limits the scan budget. The interface shows both the "
"theoretical and budgeted actual counts; `Both` never retains only one "
"direction of a pair."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:123
#: 836199b52c2443ce8c656c68a2acf3ae
msgid "**为什么元素表没有生效？** 只有选择“元素表 / 默认值”来源后才读取该表；已有磁矩模式不会自动回退到元素表。"
msgstr ""
"**Why did the element table not take effect?** The table is read only "
"after selecting the `Element table / default` source. Existing-moment "
"mode does not fall back to the element table automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:125
#: 8aa3c85d1c104acabbe1cdd76dd94ca2
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:127
#: 220a8581183f4597a8e0d6c8ec9ca08e
msgid ""
"每个成功结果写入 `spin:R:3` 并同步 ASE 初始磁矩，`Config_type` 追加 "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)`。该操作没有随机性，相同输入和参数产生相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"Every successful result is written to `spin:R:3` and synchronized with "
"ASE initial moments. "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)` is appended to "
"`Config_type`. The operation has no randomness; identical inputs and "
"parameters produce identical outputs."

